---
/**
 * Every icon used by the catalogue, emitted once per page as <symbol>s.
 *
 * The grid renders ~194 cards, each with a category icon plus two toggle
 * icons. Inlining the paths in every card would add hundreds of kilobytes of
 * DOM; referencing them with <use> keeps the markup small.
 *
 * These are decorative UI marks, freely designed — they never depict a sign.
 */
